# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Editors
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/` on purpose: git never descends into an excluded
# *directory*, so a `!` negation inside one is silently inert.
.claude/*
# The one tracked exception: this repo's project-scope permission allows are a property of
# the repo. settings.local.json and worktrees/ stay ignored.
!.claude/settings.json
